<p>QALBE ZEHRA S.A. KAT GAYA, GARDAN CHIDI BESHEER KI.</p>

<p>KIS QADAR KAARI THI ZARBAT..*2. </p>

<p>HURMULA L.A. KE TEER KI.</p>

<p>1. AY QALEELULLAH YEH GHUMNAAK MANZAR DEKHIYE..**2.</p>

<p>MUNQALIB ASGHAR ASWS. HUE HAIN**2.</p>

<p>GODH MEIN SHABBIR ASWS. KI.</p>

<p>2. KARTI HAIN BANO S.A. UDHAR BETE KA DAR PAR INTEZAAR..*2.</p>

<p>LAASH AATI HAI UDHAR SE..**2.</p>

<p>ASGHAR E BESHEER KI.</p>

<p>
3. AY FALAK ZAQMI GALA BETE KA NA MAA KO DIKHA.**2.</p>

<p>JAA'N NIKAL JAAYEGI GHAM SE..*2.</p>

<p>BANO E DILGEER S.A. KI.</p>

<p>
4. AY QUDA JJH. KE DEEN TUJHPAR HAI KARAM BESHEER KA.</p>

<p>JISNE APNE QOON SE..*2.</p>

<p>ROSHAN TERI TAQDEER KI.</p>

<p>5. KAM QAYAMAT SE NAHI MANZAR YEH MAA KE WAASTE..*2.</p>

<p>LAASHA E LAQTE JIGAR HAIN..*2.</p>

<p>ZAD PE AB SHAMSHEER KI.</p>

<p>6. AY ZAMEEN E KARBALA TUJH SE HAI BAS ITNA GILA..*2.</p>

<p>EK AMAANAT RAKH NA PAAYI..*2.</p>

<p>HAZRAT E SHABBIR ASWS. KI.</p>

<p>7. QUSHK HONTO'N PAR THA YAWAR SURA E TISHNALABI..*2.</p>

<p>QATL QUR-AA'N KA HUA..*2.</p>

<p>AAGOSH MEIN TAFSEER KI.</p>

<p>QALBE ZEHRA S.A. KAT GAYA GARDAN CHIDI BESHEER KI.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB YAWAR SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
</p>